1149
01:30:16,329 --> 01:30:17,815
Volta aqui.

1150
01:30:25,045 --> 01:30:26,626
Peguem esse cara!

1151
01:30:31,428 --> 01:30:32,596
Não atirem!

1152
01:31:14,344 --> 01:31:15,470
Disparem!

1153
01:31:24,462 --> 01:31:25,522
Corram!

1154
01:31:39,452 --> 01:31:40,578
